{"repositoryId":1112471241,"availability":"available","full":"Professional50coder/ClaimifyEasy","name":"ClaimifyEasy","description":"Prototype medical-claims workspace: role-based claim lifecycle, audit log, AI chat, coverage estimator, Solidity demos.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-12-08T17:08:34Z","updated":"2026-10-10T07:08:50Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://claimifyeasy-bice.vercel.app/","topics":["claims-management","healthcare","insurance-claims","nextjs","prototype","rbac","react","shadcn-ui","solidity","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel-ai-sdk","workflow"],"demo":"https://claimifyeasy-bice.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:01.181Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:01.181Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:01.181Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T23:49:01.181Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["One workspace where patients, hospitals, insurers and admins move a medical insurance claim from submission to settlement.","Prototype / portfolio project. Not an insurer, not a regulated product, and not insurance, medical or legal advice. Coverage figures come from illustrative rates, and AI output is advisory only. Do not enter real patient data.","Full captured output, including the coverage estimate (85,000 surgery on a \"standard\" policy, 5,000 deductible, 20% coinsurance -> 44,800 insurer share): docs/sample-output.txt."],"features":["Four roles, one pipeline. Patient submits. Hospital verifies. Insurer approves or rejects. Admin settles. Each step is enforced in code and written to an audit log.","AI where it reduces reading. A Grok-4 chat assistant answers from claim data, with an optional \"explain your reasoning\" mode and ElevenLabs voice playback. A three-agent pipeline (document extraction, fraud scoring,…","Blockchain settlement, prototyped. The app simulates smart-contract deployment and actions. A separate set of Solidity contracts (core claims, escrow, Chainlink oracle, ZK verifier stub) with Hardhat tests sits in the…","Patient files a claim with diagnosis, amount, notes and documents, then tracks it and asks the assistant \"where is my claim?\".","Hospital sees newly submitted claims and verifies them, which moves them to review."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Professional50coder/ClaimifyEasy/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"68b6c8fee68c981fe2f744aa0f69f60a84d5154127423622d4d7aaa815b3214e","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:01.287Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:01.287Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"One workspace where patients, hospitals, insurers and admins move a medical insurance claim from submission to settlement.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Professional50coder/ClaimifyEasy/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The login page simulates this.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Professional50coder/ClaimifyEasy/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Use a one-click sign-in button:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Professional50coder/ClaimifyEasy/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"68b6c8fee68c981fe2f744aa0f69f60a84d5154127423622d4d7aaa815b3214e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Professional50coder/ClaimifyEasy/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:01.288Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T07:08:50Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Professional50coder/ClaimifyEasy/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:01.289Z","hash":"68b6c8fee68c981fe2f744aa0f69f60a84d5154127423622d4d7aaa815b3214e","originalBytes":24389,"storedBytes":24389,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","claims","workflow","claim","lib","documents","chat","app","contracts","insurer","coverage","yes","admin","patient","pnpm","tests","hospital","upload","d